<title>SINGAPORE: Director of CDL Hotels resigns.</title>
<headline>Director of CDL Hotels resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>CDL Hotels International Ltd said on Friday director Edmund IP Hoi Wah had resigned with effect from December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>A statement from the company, which is the Hong Kong-listed arm of Singapore's Hong Leong group, gave no reason for the resignation.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
